WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.288 --> 00:00:16.292
Bonjour, vous avez ce pull en taille M ?
Hello, do you have this jumper in size M?

2
00:00:16.392 --> 00:00:20.156
Oui, il coûte quarante-neuf euros.
Yes, it costs forty-nine euros.

3
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:25.244
C'est un peu cher. Vous l'avez en promotion ?
That's a bit expensive. Is it on sale?

4
00:00:25.344 --> 00:00:31.124
Oui, moins vingt pour cent. Il fait trente-neuf euros vingt.
Yes, twenty percent off. It comes to 39.20.

5
00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:36.452
Parfait, je le prends. Je paie par carte.
Perfect, I'll take it. I'll pay by card.

6
00:00:36.552 --> 00:00:41.180
Très bien. Voici votre ticket.
Very good. Here is your receipt.
